{"id":17250,"author":"Stimulating","body":"So, was just thinking of creating ways we can make more opportunities to scrim in the community, as some can't even get into competitive because they are new, are on top teams people won't scrim (*coughbadcompanycough), which leaves lots of the community out on scrimmages. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cu\u003eYou don't have to leave your current team to join\u003c/u\u003e, not really looking for any highly skilled players, players of all skill levels can join this team. \u003cu\u003eI kind of stole the idea from Ginie, so credit to him for the idea.\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eApplication:\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAge:\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003eMic?:\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003eDo you speak English well?:\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe Squad:\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e-Stimulating\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e-Zlik\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e-Atdit\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e-Loo\u003cbr\u003e-Zaid\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e-Pand\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e-Hete\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e-Seth\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e-99\u003cbr\u003e-Baus\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e-Sparkz\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e-DaFrozenBlaze\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e-Whittleby","body_tagged":"So, was just thinking of creating ways we can make more opportunities to scrim in the community, as some can't even get into competitive because they are new, are on top teams people won't scrim (*coughbadcompanycough), which leaves lots of the community out on scrimmages. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cu\u003eYou don't have to leave your current team to join\u003c/u\u003e, not really looking for any highly skilled players, players of all skill levels can join this team. \u003cu\u003eI kind of stole the idea from Ginie, so credit to him for the idea.\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eApplication:\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAge:\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003eMic?:\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003eDo you speak English well?:\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\